# color and detail name WORD rows in the image word bank. The weight is that row's weight.
# color (a colour word) maps to guidance_scale. detail (w_crisp) maps to num_inference_steps.
# The map is sd_map.h. Neutral 0.50 is the draft script's default of 7.5 and 20.
# Body first. Clothes are another LAYER. "none" leaves that part off.
# This body is a mannequin in the RPG Maker super-deformed proportion:
# a large head, a short torso, short legs. It is not Asa, Ava, Lucky, or Astra.
CONCEPT | color | w_grey
CONCEPT | detail | w_crisp
LAYER | 10 | body | naked
LAYER | 20 | clothing | none
LAYER | 30 | hair | none
